s = \"italic\">American Independence Day</span>.<br/><br/><span class = \"strong\">Festival</span>:<br/>A festival is a community event. Festivals can have religious origins,  or have some cultural importance. The can also celebrate something about the natural world.<br/><br/><span class = \"strong\">Vacation</span>:<br/>A vacation is a period of recreation or rest, away from work. You can sometimes spend your vacation time away from home."}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le12ob07re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "remembering"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the action of thinking about people or events from the past"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Day of the Dead is a time of remembering. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob07aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words you use to talk about the Day of the Dead."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "happiness"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the feeling of being happy"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: It is also a time for happiness. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob07aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "dead "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "people who are no longer living"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The Day of the Dead is a traditional Mexican holiday."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le12ob07aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "cemetery"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "the area where dead people are buried"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: During this holiday, families go to the cemeteries."}, {"